          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Panel and square count guide"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Each panel is a rectangle 4 squares wide x 6 squares tall (60 x 90 cm). At size M, the two panels together give a total of 48 squares."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "To adjust width, add or remove one square from the width of both panels. XS: 3 wide x 6 tall per panel. S: 3 wide x 6 tall. M: 4 wide x 6 tall. L: 5 wide x 6 tall. XL: 5 wide x 6 tall. 2XL: 6 wide x 6 tall."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "suppliesCard",
        "attrs": {
          "heading": "Materials (size M)",
          "items": [
